---@class aws.neptunedata.GetEngineStatusOutput
---@field status? string Set to healthy if the instance is not experiencing problems. If the instance is recovering from a crash or from being rebooted and there are active transactions running from the latest server shutdown, status is set to recovery.
---@field startTime? string Set to the UTC time at which the current server process started.
---@field dbEngineVersion? string Set to the Neptune engine version running on your DB cluster. If this engine version has been manually patched since it was released, the version number is prefixed by Patch-.
---@field role? string Set to reader if the instance is a read-replica, or to writer if the instance is the primary instance.
---@field dfeQueryEngine? string Set to enabled if the DFE engine is fully enabled, or to viaQueryHint (the default) if the DFE engine is only used with queries that have the useDFE query hint set to true.
---@field gremlin? aws.neptunedata.QueryLanguageVersion Contains information about the Gremlin query language available on your cluster. Specifically, it contains a version field that specifies the current TinkerPop version being used by the engine.
---@field sparql? aws.neptunedata.QueryLanguageVersion Contains information about the SPARQL query language available on your cluster. Specifically, it contains a version field that specifies the current SPARQL version being used by the engine.
---@field opencypher? aws.neptunedata.QueryLanguageVersion Contains information about the openCypher query language available on your cluster. Specifically, it contains a version field that specifies the current operCypher version being used by the engine.
---@field labMode? aws.neptunedata.StringValuedMap Contains Lab Mode settings being used by the engine.
---@field rollingBackTrxCount? number If there are transactions being rolled back, this field is set to the number of such transactions. If there are none, the field doesn't appear at all.
---@field rollingBackTrxEarliestStartTime? string Set to the start time of the earliest transaction being rolled back. If no transactions are being rolled back, the field doesn't appear at all.
---@field features? aws.neptunedata.DocumentValuedMap Contains status information about the features enabled on your DB cluster.
---@field settings? aws.neptunedata.StringValuedMap Contains information about the current settings on your DB cluster. For example, contains the current cluster query timeout setting (clusterQueryTimeoutInMs).

---@class aws.neptunedata.GetEngineStatusRequest

