---@class aws.neptunedata.GetStorageOutput
---@field totalStorageBytesUsed? number The approximate total amount of storage used by the Neptune database instance, in bytes.
---@field quads? aws.neptunedata.QuadsIndexesInfo Contains information about the quad indexes, including counts and sizes for both RDF (SPARQL) and Property Graph (Gremlin/openCypher) data.
---@field dictionaries? aws.neptunedata.DictionariesInfo Contains information about the dictionaries, including total dictionary storage and the portion used by blob entries. For additional details on the storage of the Neptune dictionary, see Neptune Storage Billing.
---@field undoLogs? aws.neptunedata.UndoLogsMetrics Contains information about the undo logs. The sizeInBytes field represents the total size of the undo logs in bytes, and the listSize field represents the number of entries in the undo log list.
---@field streams? aws.neptunedata.StorageMetrics Contains storage metrics for the Neptune change-log streams, including size in bytes and entry count.
---@field dfeStatistics? aws.neptunedata.StorageMetrics Contains storage metrics for the Neptune DFE engine statistics, including size in bytes and entry count.
---@field schema? aws.neptunedata.StorageMetrics Contains storage metrics for the Neptune schema, including size in bytes and entry count.
---@field internals? aws.neptunedata.StorageMetrics Contains storage metrics for Neptune system metadata, including size in bytes and entry count.

